  "description": "Arbez leads an exemplary life, the champion of his world, fighting alongside the oppressed. One day, as he passed through a quiet village, celebrating the return of Taurus to the skies, he felt the presence of somebody he thought had disappeared a long time ago, but before he had time to shout out, his mind was filled with pictures and details about the end of the world. He knew he had to act, the Corruption was tainting one world after another, and Llewxam, still alive, was looking for champions who were able to stop it. He left in quest of those who would be compatible with the powers of the constellation portal Llewxam used.",
